    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "3.1.1 题面描述",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            90,
            593,
            230,
            609
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "小杨有 $n$ 个正整数，他认为一个正整数是美丽数字当且仅当该正整数每一位数字的总和是7的倍数。",
        "bbox": [
            90,
            622,
            789,
            638
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "小杨想请你编写一个程序判断 $n$ 个正整数哪些是美丽数字。",
        "bbox": [
            90,
            650,
            504,
            667
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "3.1.2 输入格式",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            90,
            680,
            231,
            697
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "第一行包含一个正整数 n，代表正整数个数。",
        "bbox": [
            90,
            709,
            403,
            724
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "之后 n 行，每行包含一个正整数。",
        "bbox": [
            90,
            739,
            329,
            755
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "3.1.3 输出格式",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            90,
            767,
            230,
            783
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "对于每个正整数，如果是美丽数字则输出 Yes，否则输出 No。",
        "bbox": [
            90,
            796,
            519,
            812
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "3.1.4 样例1",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            90,
            825,
            201,
            840
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "code",
        "sub_type": "code",
        "code_caption": [],
        "code_body": "```txt\n1 3\n2 7\n3 52\n4 103\n```",
        "bbox": [
            94,
            852,
            171,
            925
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "table",
        "img_path": "images/95e5a133fa81609690f01cd43cf4192533193b2f2ec878e733ba3e95ce315f6c.jpg",
        "table_caption": [],
        "table_footnote": [],
        "table_body": "<table><tr><td>1</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>No</td></tr></table>",
        "bbox": [
            94,
            59,
            169,
            116
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "7 的各位数字之和为 7，是 7 的倍数。52 的各位数字之和为 $5 + 2 = 7$ ，是 7 的倍数。103 的各位数字之和为 $1 + 0 + 3 = 4$ ，不是 7 的倍数。",
        "bbox": [
            90,
            131,
            842,
            163
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "对于全部数据，保证有 $1 \\leq n \\leq 10^{5}, 1 \\leq a_{i} \\leq 10^{5}$ 。",
        "bbox": [
            90,
            178,
            445,
            194
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "3.1.5 参考程序",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            90,
            207,
            230,
            223
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "code",
        "sub_type": "code",
        "code_caption": [],
        "code_body": "```txt\n#include<bits/stdc++.h>\nusing namespace std;\n\nint main(){\n    int n;\n    cin>>n;\n    int ans=0;\n    for(int i=1;i<=n;i++){\n    int x;\n    cin>>x;\n    int tot=0;\n    while(x){\n    tot+=(x%10);\n    x/=10;\n    }\n    if(tot%7==0)cout<<\"Yes\\n\";\n    else cout<<\"No\\n\";\n    }\n    return 0;\n}\n```",
        "bbox": [
            97,
            237,
            445,
            562
        ],
