        "code_body": "```cpp\n#include<bits/stdc++.h>\nusing namespace std;\nint main(){\n    int n;\n    cin >> n;\n    for(int i=1;i<=n;i++){\n    for(int j=1;j<=n;j++){\n    if(j==1||j==n)cout<<\"+\";\n    else{\n    if(i==j)cout<<\"+\";\n    else cout<<\"-\";\n    }\n    }\n    cout << \"\\n\";\n    }\n}\n```",
